        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <h2>Our Commitment to Your Privacy</h2>
        <p>At Expense Manager, we believe in complete transparency and your=
 right to privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we handle your informat=
ion.</p>

        <h2>What We Don't Collect</h2>
        <div class=3D"highlight-box">
            We do NOT collect, store, or process any Personal Information (=
PI) from our users. This includes but is not limited to: names, email addre=
sses, phone numbers, home addresses, or identification documents.
        </div>

        <h2>Data Storage</h2>
        <p>All expense data you enter in Expense Manager is stored locally =
on your device. We do not transmit, store, or access this data on external =
servers. Your financial information remains entirely in your control.</p>

        <h2>No Third-Party Sharing</h2>
        <p>Since we don't collect personal information, there is nothing to=
 share with third parties. We never sell, trade, or share your data with ad=
vertisers, analytics companies, or any other external entities.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p>We do not use cookies, pixel tags, or any tracking technologies =
to monitor your behavior or collect information about you.</p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>Your expense data is protected by your device's built-in securit=
y. We recommend:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Using strong device passwords or biometric authentication</=
li>
            <li>Keeping your device operating system updated</li>
            <li>Regularly backing up your important financial data</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Since we don't collect personal data:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>You have nothing to request deletion of</li>
            <li>You have complete control over all your expense records</li=
>
            <li>You can delete the app and all associated data at any time<=
/li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes=
 will be reflected in the application. Your continued use of Expense Manage=
r signifies your acceptance of our policy.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or o=
ur practices, please don't hesitate to reach out. We're committed to addres=
sing your privacy concerns promptly.</p>

        <div class=3D"highlight-box">
            Remember: Your privacy is paramount. Expense Manager is designe=
d with privacy-first principles to ensure your financial information remain=
s completely under your control.
        </div>

        <div class=3D"last-updated">
            <strong>Last Updated:</strong> December 22, 2025
        </div>
